# The browser holds no credentials.
#
# APP_KEY, APP_SECRET and SERVER_URL now belong to the .NET host, which is the only process that
# talks to the Affiliate Service. See backend/README.md for where to put them (user secrets or
# environment variables).
#
# The one optional variable this app reads, in vite.config.ts only, is the dev-server proxy target:
# where `/api`, `/authentication` and `/status` are forwarded while `npm run dev` is serving the UI.
#
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:5175
